# Build source, not a runtime asset. scripts/build_assets.py turns this into
# the hero-*.webp/jpg derivatives that are actually served. Shipping the
# original would add ~11 MB to the serverless bundle for a file no request
# ever reaches.
#
# NOTE: logo.png stays — the Organization JSON-LD in base.html points at
# /static/img/logo.png, so excluding it would 404 a live schema reference.
app/static/img/image1.jpg

# The entire Lok Sabha source dataset, ~10 MB. Nothing in a request path opens
# it any more: `python update.py` turns all of it into
# app/data/precomputed/lok-sabha-index.json on the build machine, and the
# deployment reads that. See app/elections/routes.py for the fallback rules —
# with no CSVs present, `_heavy_stack_available()` is False and the heavy code
# paths are never entered, which is what lets requirements.txt drop pandas.
app/data/elections/

# Dataset builders. Every module in here imports pandas or numpy at module
# scope, so none of them can be imported by the deployed function. They are
# reachable only through fallbacks that the missing dataset already closes off,
# but excluding them turns "unreachable" into "not present", which is the
# stronger guarantee.
app/elections/engine/backtest_engine.py
app/elections/engine/calibration.py
app/elections/engine/cvoter_scraper.py
app/elections/engine/daily_predictor.py
app/elections/engine/data_updater.py
app/elections/engine/election_data.py
app/elections/engine/insights.py
app/elections/engine/ml_models.py
app/elections/engine/model_optimizer.py
app/elections/engine/precompute.py
app/elections/engine/seat_predictive_model.py
app/elections/engine/sentiment_index.py
app/elections/engine/trend_analytics.py
# engine/paths.py, engine/events.py and engine/tracker_schema.py stay: routes.py
# imports paths at module scope, and events.py serves the filtered timeline.

# Design source. The reference mockups and tokens the dashboards are built
# against — read at authoring time, never at request time. The values that
# matter end up in app/static/css/style.css as custom properties.
MyDataLabs Design System/
# ...and the archive it came out of. Excluding only the folder left the 11.5 MB
# zip in the bundle, which is most of the serverless size limit spent on a file
# no request opens.
*.zip

tests/
scripts/
docs/
trash/
feedback_claude.md
README_CLOUDRUN.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
deploy.py

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
